,'2026-10-21 14:55:56'),(29,'recolte-fine-art-nail-painting-gel','Recolte Fine Art Nail Painting Gel','Extra-dense micro-pigmented painting gel for intricate linework, portraits & French smiles',NULL,16,'Painting Gel',NULL,NULL,4.90,140,0,1,39,'/uploads/products/catalog/PAINTING_GEL_Nail_Art_1_.jpg','[\"/uploads/products/catalog/PAINTING_GEL_Nail_Art_1_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/PAINTING_GEL_Nail_Art_3_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/PAINTING_GEL_Nail_Art_4_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/PAINTING_GEL_Video_for_nail_art_gel.mp4\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/PAINTING_GEL_Nail_Art_5_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/PAINTING_GEL_Nail_Art_6_.jpg\"]','Crafted specifically for nail artists who demand extreme detail. Ultra-high pigment concentration allows paper-thin lines with 100% opacity that do not spread, bleed, or shrink before curing.','[\"Single-Stroke Ultra Pigmentation\", \"Does Not Bleed or Shrink\", \"Razor-Sharp Precision Lines\", \"Tack-Free Finish\"]','Micronized Artist-Grade Pigments, Non-Drip Structural Resins, Optical Stabilizers','1. Pick up a minute bead with a fine detail brush (size 00 or 000). 2. Draw crisp linework or art onto matte or cleansed surface. 3. Cure 60s.','[]','[\"5gm\"]','2026-09-26 13:16:40','2026-10-21 14:55:56'),(30,'recolte-platinum-foil-glitter-gel','Recolte Platinum Glitter Gel','Heavyweight crushed foil and diamond micro-glitter gel for opulent starlight sparkle','NEW!',17,'Platinum Gel',0.00,NULL,4.90,147,0,1,0,'/uploads/products/catalog/PLATINUM_GEL_Platinum_Gel_1_.jpg','[\"/uploads/products/catalog/PLATINUM_GEL_Platinum_Gel_1_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/PLATINUM_GEL_Platinum_Gel_3_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/PLATINUM_GEL_Platinum_Gel_1_.mp4\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/PLATINUM_GEL_Platinum_Gel_4_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/PLATINUM_GEL_Platinum_Gel_5_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/PLATINUM_GEL_Platinum_Gel_6_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/PLATINUM_GEL_Platinum_Gel_7_.jp