 14:55:56'),(32,'recolte-acid-free-dehydrating-bond-primer','Recolte Acid-Free Dehydrating Bond Primer','Gentle non-acid natural nail dehydrator and bonding agent ensuring 0% lifting','NEW!',19,'Primer',0.00,NULL,4.90,161,0,1,0,'/uploads/products/catalog/PRIMER_primer.jpg','[\"/uploads/products/catalog/PRIMER_primer.jpg\"]','Essential preparation for any long-wearing manicure. Quickly evaporates natural surface oils and moisture from the nail plate while depositing a sticky molecular bonding film that locks gel base coat to keratin.','[]','Ethyl Acetate Dehydrating Complex, Molecular Adhesion Promoters, Panthenol Fortifier','1. Gently buff natural nail surface and wipe with cleanser. 2. Brush a sparing amount of Primer across the nail plate. 3. Air dry for 30-40 seconds until slightly tacky. 4. Apply Base Coat.','[{\"hex\": \"#f7f5f0\", \"name\": \"Clear Prep Bond\", \"image\": \"\"}]','[\"15ml Glass Bottle with Precision Applicator\"]','2026-09-26 13:16:40','2026-10-21 14:55:56'),(33,'recolte-24-flash-reflective-glitter-gel-polish','Recolte 24 Flash Reflective Glitter Gel Polish','Hypnotic light-activated diamond flash disco gel polish bursting with brilliant luminescence',NULL,20,'Reflective Polish',NULL,NULL,4.90,168,0,1,43,'/uploads/products/catalog/REFLECTIVE_POLISH_Recolte-24_Flash_3_.jpg','[\"/uploads/products/catalog/REFLECTIVE_POLISH_Recolte-24_Flash_3_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/REFLECTIVE_POLISH_Recolte-24_Flash_4_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/REFLECTIVE_POLISH_Recolte-24_Flash.mp4\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/REFLECTIVE_POLISH_Recolte-24_Flash_5_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/REFLECTIVE_POLISH_Recolte-24_Flash_6_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/REFLECTIVE_POLISH_Recolte-24_Flash_7_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/REFLECTIVE_POLISH_bottle_2_.jpg\"]','Featuring advanced retroreflective crystal beads that capture and bounce direct light. Appears as a classy subtle micro-shimmer under normal daytime ambient lighting, and explodes i