','High Tensile Cyano-Acrylate Copolymer, Elastic Optical Gel Matrix, UV Curative Catalysts','1. Apply a dot or bead of Rhinestone Gel where charm or crystal will sit. 2. Place crystal and gently press into position. 3. Cure 60-90s under UV/LED lamp. No wiping required.','[{\"hex\": \"#FFFFFF\", \"name\": \"Crystal Clear Cement\"}]','[\"15gm\"]','2026-09-26 13:16:40','2026-10-21 14:55:56'),(35,'recolte-5-in-1-fortifying-rubber-base-coat','Recolte 5-in-1 Rubber Base Coat','Multifunctional rubberized elastic base for apex reinforcement, natural nail repair & strength',NULL,22,'Rubber Base',NULL,NULL,4.90,182,0,1,45,'/uploads/products/catalog/RUBBER_BASE_5-in-1_Rubber_Base_1_.jpg','[\"/uploads/products/catalog/RUBBER_BASE_5-in-1_Rubber_Base_1_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/RUBBER_BASE_5-in-1_Rubber_Base_2_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/RUBBER_BASE_5in1_rubber_base.mp4\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/RUBBER_BASE_5-in-1_Rubber_Base_3_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/RUBBER_BASE_5in1_rubber_base.jpg\"]','A resilient rubberized base gel that bends with the natural nail rather than cracking. Fills deep ridges, repairs split nails, builds structural apexes, and provides a translucent milky or nude color overlay in one simple step.','[\"5-in-1: Base, Builder, Apex Leveler, Strengthener & Color\", \"Bends with Natural Nail to Prevent Cracking\", \"Ideal for Weak, Bitten or Ridged Nails\", \"Self-Levels in Seconds\"]','Rubberized Elastic Monomer Blend, Calcium & Keratin Reinforcers, Natural Mineral Tints','1. Prep and prime natural nail. 2. Apply a thin slip layer of Rubber Base, followed by a small bead to build apex. 3. Flip hand upside down for 5s to self-level. 4. Cure 60s under LED lamp.','[{\"hex\": \"#ECE5DF\", \"name\": \"Clear\"}, {\"hex\": \"#F8F4F0\", \"name\": \"Milky White\"}, {\"hex\": \"#F5C2A5\", \"name\": \"Peach\"}, {\"hex\": \"#F0B2BA\", \"name\": \"Pink\"}]','[\"15ml\"]','2026-09-26 13:16:40','2026-10-21 14:55:56'),(36,'recolte-solid-glue-gel-for-full-cover-tips','Recolte Solid Glue Gel for Full Cover Tips','Solid non-stick putty gel for applying soft gel tips and press-ons with zero bubbles or spillage',NULL,23,'Solid Glue Gel',NULL,NULL,4.90,189,0,1,46,'/uploads/products/catalog/SOLID_GLUE_GEL_Solid_Glue_Gel_1_.jpg','[\"/uploads/products/catalog/SOLID_GLUE_GEL_Solid_Glue_Gel_1_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/SOLID_GLUE_GEL_Solid_Glue_Gel_2_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/SOLID_GLUE_GEL_Solid_Glue_Gel_3_.jpg\"]','The modern revolution in press-on and soft gel tip application. Solid putty texture can be rolled with fingers, placed inside the tip, and pressed onto the natural nail without any sticky liquid flooding the cuticle or creating air bubbles.','[\"Solid Putty Form - Does Not Run into Cuticles\", \"Adjust Tip Position Freely Before UV Cure\", \"Zero Air Bubbles Under Clear Extension Tips\", \"Holds Firm for 30+ Days\"]','Solidified Acrylate Polymer Matrix, High-Adhesion Tackifiers, Photo-Initiating Resins','1. Prep natural nail and apply primer. 2. Scoop a small sphere of Solid Glue Gel into the base of the full-cover tip. 3. Press firmly from cuticle to free edge, squeezing out all air. 4. Flash cure 10s, then full cure 60s.','[{\"hex\": \"#FFFFFF\", \"name\": \"Crystal Clear Solid Glue\"}]','[\"15g Solid Pot\", \"25g Studio Pot\"]','2026-09-26 13:16:40','2026-10-22 02:59:41'),(37,'recolte-matrix-elastic-line-spider-gel','Recolte Matrix Elastic Line Spider Gel','Super-elastic matrix gel that stretches into razor-thin straight lines and geometric nail art',NULL,24,'Spider Gel',NULL,NULL,4.90,196,0,1,47,'/uploads/products/catalog/SPIDER_GEL_Spider_Gel_1_.jpg','[\"/uploads/products/catalog/SPIDER_GEL_Spider_Gel_1_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/SPIDER_GEL_Spider_Gel_3_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/SPIDER_GEL_Spider_Gel_1_.mp4\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/SPIDER_GEL_Spider_Gel_4_.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/SPIDER_GEL_Spider_Gel_5_.jpg\"]','With extreme tensile elasticity, Recolte Spider Gel pulls out of the pot like a spider web and drapes across the nail in impossibly straight geometric lines, french edges, and abstract cage designs without snapping.','[\"Ultra-Elastic High Viscosity Spider Formula\", \"Draws Perfectly Straight Lines with Dotting Tool\", \"Zero Breakage Mid-Air\", \"Deep Pigment with No Shrinking\"]','Elastic Polyurethane Matrix, High Viscosity Stabilizers, Concentrated Carbon/Titanium Pigments','1. Dip a dotting tool or fine brush into the gel and lift upwards to draw an elastic thread. 2. Lay the thread across the nail in your desired pattern. 3. Clean sidewalls and cure 60s. 4. Seal with Top Coat.','[{\"hex\": \"#FFFFFF\", \"name\": \"White\"}, {\"hex\": \"#111111\", \"name\": \"Black\"}, {\"hex\": \"#F4EFEB\", \"name\": \"Clear\"}]','[\"5g\"]','2026-09-26 13:16:40','2026-10-21 14:55:56'),(40,'recolte-excellent-base-coat','Recolte Excellent Base Coat','60 Days+ Strong Adhesion Natural Resin Base Coat with Keratin Protection','NEW!',8,'Base Coat',0.00,NULL,4.98,196,1,1,0,'/uploads/products/catalog/BASE_COAT_base.png','[\"/uploads/products/catalog/BASE_COAT_base.png\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/BASE_COAT_base_top.png\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/BASE_COAT_base_coat.mp4\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/BASE_COAT_base_coat.png\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/BASE_COAT_base_and_top.png\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/BASE_COAT_white_bottle_1_.JPG\"]','Engineered with high-purity natural tree resins and a purified water-clarified formula, Recolte Excellent Base Coat provides up to 60+ days of unwavering adhesion without chipping or lifting. The acid-free, odorless formulation forms a protective barrier over the natural nail keratin while auto-leveling seamlessly. Easy soak-off in 5–8 minutes with zero natural nail damage.','[]','Extracted Natural Tree Resin, Purified Deionized Base, Medical-Grade Polyurethane Acrylate, HEMA-Free Photo-Initiators, Keratin Vitamin Shield','1. Cleanse and dehydrate natural nail with Recolte Primer. 2. Apply a thin, uniform coat of Excellent Base Coat capping the free edge. 3. Cure for 60 seconds under UV/LED lamp. 4. Follow with your chosen Recolte gel polish.','[]','[\"15ml Precision Atelier Bottle\", \"30ml Salon Refill\"]','2026-09-26 13:29:42','2026-10-21 14:55:56'),(39,'recolte-6-in-1-diamond-hard-top-coat','Recolte 6-in-1 No Wipe Top Coat','Multifunctional reinforced hard seal top coat for apex overlay, chrome buffing, and extreme durability',NULL,26,'6-in-1 Top Coat',NULL,NULL,4.95,125,0,1,49,'/uploads/products/catalog/6_IN_1_TOP_COAT_6-in-1_Top_Coat.jpg','[\"/uploads/products/catalog/6_IN_1_TOP_COAT_6-in-1_Top_Coat.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/6_IN_1_TOP_COAT_02.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/6_IN_1_TOP_COAT_03.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/6_IN_1_TOP_COAT_6-in-1_Top_Coat_video_demonstration.mp4\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/6_IN_1_TOP_COAT_04.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/6_IN_1_TOP_COAT_05-1.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/6_IN_1_TOP_COAT_05.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/6_IN_1_TOP_COAT_06.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/6_IN_1_TOP_COAT_07.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/6_IN_1_TOP_COAT_08.jpg\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/6_IN_1_TOP_COAT_09.jpg\"]','The ultimate all-in-one salon weapon. Serves as a reinforced hard gel top coat, apex building overlay, encapsulating gel for glitters and dried florals, mirror chrome powder rubbing base, diamond sealer, and nail fortifier.','[\"6-in-1: Hard Top, Chrome Base, Apex Seal, Encapsulation, Scratch Armor & High Gloss\", \"Reinforces Soft Nails with Hard Gel Strength\", \"Super Mirror Luster with No Scuffs\", \"Optimal Base for Chrome Powder Rubbing\"]','Hard Glass-Resin Polymer, High-Viscosity Capping Monomers, Optical Glaze Fortifiers','1. Apply as hard sealing top coat, or cure 30s to use as the perfect base for mirror chrome powder burnishing. 2. Full cure 60 seconds. Non-wipe formula.','[{\"hex\": \"#FFFFFF\", \"name\": \"Clear\"}]','[\"50gm\"]','2026-09-26 13:16:40','2026-10-21 14:55:56'),(42,'recolte-long-wear-no-wipe-top-coat','Recolte Long Wear No Wipe Top Coat','Super Bright Luxury Glassy Surface with Anti-Scratch & 4-Week Mirror Durability','NEW!',25,'Top Coats',0.00,NULL,4.98,203,1,1,0,'/uploads/products/catalog/TOP_COATS_top.png','[\"/uploads/products/catalog/TOP_COATS_top.png\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/TOP_COATS_top_coat_1_.png\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/TOP_COATS_top_coat_2_.png\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/TOP_COATS_top_coat.mp4\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/TOP_COATS_top..png\", \"/uploads/products/catalog/TOP_COATS_white_bottle_1_.JPG\"]','Engineered with tempered glass molecular structure, this no-wipe top coat forms an impenetrable high-luster shield. Repels micro-scratches from keys and abrasive contact, keeping manicures gleaming wet for over a month.','[]','Tempered Siloxane Polymer, Optical Clarifying Monomers, Non-Wipe Photo-Catalysts','1. Apply after your gel color application. 2. Cap free edge and coat nail evenly. 3. Cure 60 seconds under LED lamp. No alcohol wipe needed.','[{\"hex\": \"#ffffff\", \"name\": \"Tempered Crystal Gloss\", \"image\": \"\"}]','[\"15ml Studio Bottle\", \"30ml Master Refill\"]','2026-09-26 13:29:42','2026-10-21 14:55:56');
